      "id": "b2",
      "function": "problem",
      "scene_type": "gs_numbers",
      "spoken": "The tunnel links Innsbruck in Austria with Franzensfeste in Italy over 55 kilometres. Add the Innsbruck bypass and you get 64 tunnel kilometres. According to the builder, it will be the longest underground rail link in the world.",
