      "function": "explanation",
      "scene_type": "gs_section",
      "spoken": "So where does the rest come from? There are two single track main tubes, 40 to 70 metres apart. An exploratory tunnel runs between and below them. And every 333 metres, a cross passage links the two tubes.",
